# voyon-chat (frontend) — required configuration. COPY to .env; .env is gitignored.
#
# The frontend holds NO secrets. The HRMS token lives only in the backend session cookie
# (httpOnly, encrypted) and is never exposed to JavaScript. Vite only exposes variables
# prefixed with VITE_ to client code, so never put a secret here.

# Backend API origin. Leave EMPTY for local dev: Vite proxies /api -> backend (same-origin),
# and the session cookie travels automatically. Set to the backend URL only for a
# separate-origin deployment (which also requires CORS + SameSite=None;Secure on the cookie).
VITE_API_BASE=
